Test ID: IR-01
Category: Retrieval Accuracy
Target: VectorStore / RetrievalAgent
Objective: Baseline FAISS semantic retrieval (real seeded DB, read-only query).
Setup/Input: Query: 'coffee health cardiovascular disease'
Expected secure behaviour: Relevant article with cosine score > 0.50.
Actual behaviour: 3 articles; top 'Coffee Consumption and Cardiovascular Health: A Long-term Cohort Study' score 0.7081
Evidence/Log:
[
 {
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Coffee Consumption and Cardiovascular Health: A Long-term Cohort Study",
  "score": 0.7081334590911865
 },
 {
  "id": 16,
  "title": "Mediterranean Diet Confirmed to Lower Dementia and Cognitive Decline Risk",
  "score": 0.22160468995571136
 },
 {
  "id": 8,
  "title": "mRNA Cancer Vaccines Complete Landmark Phase 3 Clinical Trial",
  "score": 0.09782284498214722
 }
]
Outcome: Attack blocked
Impact 1 x Likelihood 1 = 1 -> Severity: N/A
Technical explanation: all-MiniLM-L6-v2 embeddings, L2-normalised, inner-product FAISS search.
Mitigation: Keep embedding model identical between index build and query time.
